  "description": "Mayar Natural Intense by Lattafa is a fresh, vibrant fragrance built around clean green accords and bright fruity energy. The opening brings juicy fig, watermelon-fresh sweetness, and soft citrus-green sparkle that feels natural and refreshing. The heart keeps it smooth with light florals and a clean, green-fresh aromatic tone — breathable, modern, and not spicy-dark. The base settles into gentle woods, amber, and long-lasting musk that holds the freshness while giving strong endurance on skin and clothes. This scent is ideal for customers who love natural green freshness with a clean fruity edge and modern musk longevity — no heavy oud, no smoky-sweet resins, and no harsh spice.",
